=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nLDh9gfTY00Q7kNvwHlcQOi&_nc_oc=Adp3Bd9V6CfYcozyS9EciSn9N6Ot5VEYHaIYuakP0n4fCG7bUPIBZe3ZgPXYMIw0cb8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBISdFNaC-9tBVTfdjXcTUZOehVWWJudRnawm9vsCAhw&oe=6A5234A2"}, {"file_name": "PlayerDamage01_2560x1440.png", "id": "1147109633473090", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391930_1147109636806423_6909828639526574047_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z2glfHL19igQ7kNvwEq5JHv&_nc_oc=AdrgSJr5xlcAmmOmrEBjqRRFQqyhaVNgDAMC56cSTCPbN9nxcXtxsWoF6mQAKROKy9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD36KRbbW0pjwaDAemin7KF33E0jE4J2YDcs9EPOkSO4Q&oe=6A524AAD"}, {"file_name": "Sniper01_2560x1440.png", "id": "619526613778310", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_619526617111643_4779182521656177024_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZXNNBe_I8XcQ7kNvwHs-y_D&_nc_oc=AdqySu3Abg19fjOP3gZbfeKISTbQYk0TRvmdFnp9eVW4IKc5GfepY-UxVvTmQhP2GAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB6Yq_w7UCag8HSqnDrkQpIt-q17G3WeggVlIcvnHfRqQ&oe=6A525CC4"}, {"file_name": "DualWield02_2560x1440.png", "id": "2846696975512873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391971_2846696978846206_3152004226380843791_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PcL-Ymh9ZDgQ7kNvwEwmh5l&_nc_oc=AdphjYffU5ajBgi1eXlBXuJYW6lZx8tuyRWwk5ecYZG2j2vgEIKhtisCjiPsRsVGCl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAxuNV66LDS_6foBrkrpv0NLZLW5dr8F8gnAsqhPflPgg&oe=6A522F59"}, {"file_name": "LOH-Planet_2560x1440.png", "id": "1027032369454852", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391913_1027032372788185_6272348873203520910_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mevFO6xMCa4Q7kNvwFXeLNT&_nc_oc=AdoPCELkuN44SS5HOgISirAmWnpCU5Aqnxb14A-6yZ1JsPVvUK9lkKh2-XdB-xhkM7A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBhjiN2VlvkDwOpaeCN93xDKIfVcL7yQCXeXuK9ZrXKew&oe=6A5241EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hack The System", "keywords": ["scifi", "shooter", "spy", "agent", "narrative"], "long_description": "# HACK THE SYSTEM\n**A Sci-Fi Wave Shooter**\n\nThe Constitutional Federal Technocracy maintains an illusion of total efficiency, pragmatism and control. The Agency knows better. Operating from the shadows, they ensure order in a world that secretly teeters on the brink of chaos.\n\nFor over 200 years, the CFT has been free of all deadly disease. Now, a new plague called Tracosis has claimed the lives of millions across the Central Systems. \n\nYour objective is simple: eliminate threats, secure classified data, and maintain control. But as your missions unfold, troubling secrets begin to surface...\n\n**Key Features**\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Wave-Shooter\n\nEach level will bring waves of enemies as you attempt to secure various locations. Use cover, movement, and precision shooting to survive escalating encounters.\n\n{1344938703584295}\n\n\ud83c\udf06 7 Locations\n\nBattle across diverse environments, from neon-lit cityscapes and corporate skyscrapers to underground bio-labs.\n\n{965507812213056}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b 5 Advanced Weapons\n\nEquip yourself with a deadly arsenal of weaponry.\n\n{1284872422779690}\n\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f A Dark Sci-Fi Story\n\nUnravel a subtle narrative of power, control, and rebellion.\n\n{460015863845390}", "short_description": "Step into the role of an elite Operative working for The Agency, a shadowy government organization that thrives on secrecy and precision. Armed with cutting-edge weaponry, you will neutralize threats and maintain order\u2014at any cost."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.corestrand.net/hack-the-system-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Core Strand LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https:/